{"attempts": 1, "body": {"identifier": "port", "properties": {"credentials": "PORT_CLIENT_ID, PORT_CLIENT_SECRET", "criticality": "critical", "docs_url": "https://docs.port.io", "failure_mode": "The plan lookup fails, so no lane spawns. The run stops rather than proceeding ungoverned.", "fallback": "Dry mode: requests spool to port/spool/*.jsonl and reads replay from them. Clearly labelled, never presented as a live call.", "kind": "governance", "purpose": "Context Lake, scorecards, and the approval gate the release path reads."}, "title": "Port"}, "hash": "28741dc9f17be4039f10e39ffee05ab4", "method": "POST", "mode": "live", "path": "/blueprints/daisy_service/entities", "prev": "b63df8a800126e16038fe1640e1a3305", "resource": "entity:daisy_service:port", "seq": 12, "status": 201, "ts": 1787440527.01}
{"attempts": 1, "body": {"identifier": "bright_data", "properties": {"credentials": "BRIGHTDATA_API_TOKEN", "criticality": "critical", "docs_url": "https://docs.brightdata.com", "failure_mode": "hardware.margins raises NoGroundTruth. The part is not certified; there is deliberately no fallback table in the code path.", "fallback": "None, by design. A hardcoded price would turn a data pipeline into a constant and nobody would notice.", "kind": "data", "purpose": "Vendor fastener rows and design-DNA reference pages \u2014 the ground truth the physics gate selects against."}, "title": "Bright Data"}, "hash": "f005652e71a862d4c5441c46fde4e1c2", "method": "POST", "mode": "live", "path": "/blueprints/daisy_service/entities", "prev": "28741dc9f17be4039f10e39ffee05ab4", "resource": "entity:daisy_service:bright_data", "seq": 13, "status": 201, "ts": 1787440528.117}
{"attempts": 1, "body": {"identifier": "signoz", "properties": {"credentials": "SIGNOZ_INGESTION_KEY", "criticality": "important", "docs_url": "https://signoz.io/docs", "failure_mode": "Escalation goes silent \u2014 a run can hang without anyone being told.", "fallback": "The gate results are still written to Port, so the run is auditable after the fact; it just is not noticed in time.", "kind": "observability", "purpose": "Spans per lane and the alert that escalates a stuck run to a human."}, "title": "SigNoz"}, "hash": "2c64f534b8fac423662fad24073e597a", "method": "POST", "mode": "live", "path": "/blueprints/daisy_service/entities", "prev": "f005652e71a862d4c5441c46fde4e1c2", "resource": "entity:daisy_service:signoz", "seq": 14, "status": 201, "ts": 1787440529.127}
{"attempts": 1, "body": {"identifier": "claude_code", "properties": {"credentials": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (or an authenticated CLI)", "criticality": "important", "docs_url": "https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code", "failure_mode": "Those lanes fail their gates and the run blocks. It never releases unbuilt work.", "fallback": "The Codex lane still runs; the contract gate catches the half-built result rather than merging it.", "kind": "agent", "purpose": "Frontend and hardware lanes, run headless in their own worktrees."}, "title": "Claude Code"}, "hash": "c534adbd50402e550cc10ff145398346", "method": "POST", "mode": "live", "path": "/blueprints/daisy_service/entities", "prev": "2c64f534b8fac423662fad24073e597a", "resource": "entity:daisy_service:claude_code", "seq": 15, "status": 201, "ts": 1787440530.352}
